{"id":"steam-1379880","steam":1379880,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"RED MACHINA","summary":"A narrative-driven atmospheric horror game. You are X and find yourself in the Red Machina system, a virtual paradise on the brink of collapse.","about":"Red Machina is a virtual system created to fulfill the darkest desires of its players. X, the last player to access it, finds himself trapped in a plot of corruption, betrayal, and collapse.\n\nDisturbing Secrets Await You\n\nAs you explore different maps, you will encounter unique stories and gameplay. Each character plays a key role in accomplishing your mission;\n\nNPCs feature multiple dialogue choices, allowing players to shape X’s personality as they wish— aggressive, passive, emotional, or chaotic;\n\nRetro Visuals\n\nResident Evil 1, Silent Hill, and Cosmology of Kyoto are the main inspirations for Red Machina’s graphics and visuals.\n\n• \nAudio faithful to PSX limitations;\n• \nVertex lighting;\n• \nTextures inspired by the restrictions of the original PlayStation era;\n\nPuzzles and Dilemmas\n\nPuzzles and dialogues define the type of player you are, as well as the consequences this will bring to X’s story.\n\nAverage playtime: 2  hours.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/b26d6b5e8e11181c0aa9da892d988423d396243f/library_capsule.jpg?t=1785584559","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/c1c6454ba5885d2455beb2d58582f69db8d617f4/header.jpg?t=1785584559","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/b82a5d6484998d657ad95e6d01e1938663cb2a05/library_hero.jpg?t=1785584559","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/c1c6454ba5885d2455beb2d58582f69db8d617f4/header.jpg?t=1785584559","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/fcfba5f965c6f1655484250016a289e540113922/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1785584559","